","SecondaryAttribute":"Please come up with a funny answer to this question: What is a terrible title for a motivational...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Please come up with a funny answer to this question:<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<em><strong>What is a terrible title for a motivational seminar?<\/strong><\/em>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"TE","Selector":"ML","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","InputWidth":650,"InputHeight":113},"QuestionDescription":"Please come up with a funny answer to this question: What is a terrible title for a motivational...","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"SearchSource":{"AllowFreeResponse":"false"},"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"What would be an unusual thing to bring to a classroom show-and-tell?&nbsp;<br><br>What would be the worst gift you can bring to a wedding?&nbsp;<br><br>What would be a terrible name for a motivational seminar?&nbsp;<br><br>What would be a strange theme for a big high-school graduation party?&nbsp;<br><br>What would be a fast way to make a room go quiet?\n<br>","DataExportTag":"seminar_text","QuestionID":"QID129"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_beCwh21tbtNmS7c","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID130","SecondaryAttribute":"Your answer was:\u00a0${q:\/\/QID129\/ChoiceTextEntryValue} In your opinion, how funny is your answer to...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Your answer was:&nbsp;${q:\/\/QID129\/ChoiceTextEntryValue}<br><br><br>In your opinion, how funny is your answer to the question?","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Your answer was:\u00a0${q:\/\/QID129\/ChoiceTextEntryValue} In your opinion, how funny is your answer to...","Choices":{"18":{"Display":"1. Not at all funny"},"19":{"Display":"2."},"20":{"Display":"3."},"21":{"Display":"4."},"22":{"Display":"5. Very funny"}},"ChoiceOrder":["18","19","20","21","22"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":23,"NextAnswerId":1,"DefaultChoices":false,"RecodeValues":{"18":"1","19":"2","20":"3","21":"4","22":"5"},"VariableNaming":{"18":"","19":"","20":"","21":"","22":""},"GradingData":[],"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"In your opinion, how funny is your answer to the question?","DataExportTag":"seminar_self","QuestionID":"QID130"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_beCwh21tbtNmS7c","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID45","SecondaryAttribute":"WRITING FUNNY ANSWERS TO QUIRKY QUESTIONS \u00a0 \u00a0 We're interested in the psychology of humor, like h.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div><strong>WRITING FUNNY ANSWERS TO QUIRKY QUESTIONS<\/strong><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\nWe're interested in the psychology of humor, like how people come up with funny and witty ideas.&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>For this task, you'll be asked some quirky questions, and your goal is to respond by <em><strong>writing funny answers<\/strong><\/em>.&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>For example, if you were asked, <em>What is a good way to survive a long, boring meeting?<\/em>, your goal would be to come up with a funny answer.<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>All ways of being funny are welcome. People have different senses of humor, and it's okay if your sense of humor is really \"out there.\"&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><strong><em>What you write can be weird, absurd, gross, dirty-minded, bizarre, offensive, random, or whatever<\/em><\/strong>, so long as you're trying to come up with something really funny.\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Humor_Instruc_1","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"WRITING FUNNY ANSWERS TO QUIRKY QUESTIONS \u00a0 \u00a0 We're interested in the psychology of humor, like h...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID45","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_beCwh21tbtNmS7c","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID75","SecondaryAttribute":"Please come up with a funny answer to this question: What is an odd choice for a first date activ...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Please come up with a funny answer to this question:<br><br><br><strong><em>What is an odd choice for a first date activity?<\/em><\/strong>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"TE","Selector":"ML","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","InputWidth":650,"InputHeight":113},"QuestionDescription":"Please come up with a funny answer to this question: What is an odd choice for a first date activ...","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"SearchSource":{"AllowFreeResponse":"false"},"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<div>Here's a set-up for a joke for you to finish. Remember, what you write can be weird, gross, silly, bizarre, random, dirty-minded, or whatever, so long as you're trying to come up with something really funny: &nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div style=\"margin-left: 40px;\"><em>Imagine that one of your friends wants your opinion on how well she sings. She sings a minute or two to demonstrate her voice, and you cringe\u2014she might be the worst singer you\u2019ve ever heard. When she asks, \u201cSo, how was it?\u201d you decide to be honest, so you say, \u201cTo be honest, listening to that...\u201d<\/em><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"margin-left: 40px;\">&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>Please finish the joke by typing something funny below!<\/div>","DataExportTag":"firstdate_text","QuestionID":"QID75"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_beCwh21tbtNmS7c","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID76","SecondaryAttribute":"Your answer was:\u00a0${q:\/\/QID75\/ChoiceTextEntryValue} In your opinion, how funny is your answer to t..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Your answer was:&nbsp;${q:\/\/QID75\/ChoiceTextEntryValue}<br><br><br>In your opinion, how funny is your answer to the question?","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Your answer was:\u00a0${q:\/\/QID75\/ChoiceTextEntryValue} In your opinion, how funny is your answer to t...","Choices":{"18":{"Display":"1. Not at all funny"},"19":{"Display":"2."},"20":{"Display":"3."},"21":{"Display":"4."},"22":{"Display":"5. Very funny"}},"ChoiceOrder":["18","19","20","21","22"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":23,"NextAnswerId":1,"DefaultChoices":false,"RecodeValues":{"18":"1","19":"2","20":"3","21":"4","22":"5"},"VariableNaming":{"18":"","19":"","20":"","21":"","22":""},"GradingData":[],"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"In your opinion, how funny is your ending to the joke?","DataExportTag":"firstdate_self","QuestionID":"QID76"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_beCwh21tbtNmS7c","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID93","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Timing","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"time_firstdate","QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","MinSeconds":"0","MaxSeconds":"0"},"QuestionDescription":"Timing","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":48,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID93"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_beCwh21tbtNmS7c","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID94","SecondaryAttribute":"So, on the next six pages, you\u2019ll read a quirky question, and the task is to come up with a reall.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"So, on the next six pages, you\u2019ll read a quirky question, and the task is to come up with a really funny answer to it, like something that your friends would find funny.&nbsp;<br>\n<br>\nThere's no time or word limit. You can take as much time or as little time as you like, and what you write can be as short or long as you like. The important thing is to try to be funny.&nbsp;<br>\n<br>\nWe're interested in <strong><em>your ideas<\/em><\/strong>, not something from Google, AI, or the Internet, so please come up with the ideas on your own.<br><br>Click \"Next\" to start, and have fun with it!","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Humor_Instruc_2 ","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"So, on the next six pages, you\u2019ll read a quirky question, and the task is to come up with a reall...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID94"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_beCwh21tbtNmS7c","Element":"STAT","PrimaryAttribute":"Survey Statistics","SecondaryAttribute":null,"TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"MobileCompatible":true,"ID":"Survey Statistics"}}]}